WEBVTT

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:10.900
There's just something super magical about

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.040
when it translates into this physical form

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:17.740
and it's like something you're holding in your hand, or going to be

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.600
manipulated on screen

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.940
That physical connection, that human element,

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.900
it is really bold and special that Laika

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.120
is still invested in that artistry

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:37.000
Any good artist will take reference

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.120
from the things around them

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.500
and it's a pretty clear translation from where we live

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.940
to the world that we're building

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:52.940
Stop motion has really deep roots here in Portland

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:55.720
and Laika is a big part of that
